{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":114,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܦܠܝܼܛ ܠܹܗ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܸܨܪܹܝܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܹܝܬ ܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂ ܡ̣ܢ ܥܲܡܵܐ ܕܠܸܫܵܢܵܐ ܦܪܝܼܫܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܘܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܝܼܗܘܼܕܵܐ ܩܘܼܕܫܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ ܫܘܼܠܛܵܢܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܡܵܐ ܚܙܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇ ܘܥܪܝܼܩ ܠܵܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܘܿܪܕܢܵܢ ܕܝܼܪܹܗ ܠܒܵܬܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܪܩܝܼܕ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܒܲܪ̈ܥܵܢܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪ̈ܘܼܡܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܦܹܐܪܹ̈ܐ ܕܦܸܣܩܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܐ ܠܵܟ݂ܝ ܝܵܡܵܐ ܕܥܵܪܩܲܬ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܘܿܪܕܢܵܢ ܕܕܵܝܪܹܬ ܠܒܵܬܪܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܕܪܵܩܕܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܒܲܪ̈ܥܵܢܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪ̈ܘܼܡܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܦܹܐܪܹ̈ܐ ܕܦܸܣܩܵܐ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܓܘܿܕܝ ܡ̣ܢ ܩܲܕܡ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܩܲܕܡ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܡܘܼܚܕܸܪܹܗ ܩܵܝܵܐ ܠܒܸܪ̈ܟܹܐ ܕܡ̈ܝܼܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܸܡܛܵܐ ܠܥܲܝܢܵܐ ܕܡ̈ܝܼܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}